  "key_findings": [
    "SPY-conditioned overnight gap alpha existed only in pre-night-session era (2012-2017, Sharpe 5.155)",
    "Post night session (2017+), the alpha completely disappeared (Sharpe -0.590) because SPY info is now priced in during the overlapping night session",
    "Night session analysis: same-day SPY signal gives Sharpe 6.947 (LOOKAHEAD), lag-corrected gives -0.083",
    "The night session (15:00-05:00 Taiwan) overlaps with US market (21:30-04:00 Taiwan) — simultaneous, not predictive",
    "K515 overnight gap alpha was real in 2012-2017 but is now structurally extinct — TAIFEX night session eliminated the information asymmetry",
    "Cost savings from TX futures (2bp vs 18.55bp ETF) are irrelevant since the alpha no longer exists",
