  "conclusion": "NULL RESULT for tradeable strategy. The SPY-conditioned overnight gap alpha (K515) was real in the pre-night-session era (2012-2017) when the 19-hour trading gap allowed SPY information to accumulate unpriced. After TAIFEX introduced the night session (~2017-05-22), the gap shrunk to 3.75 hours and SPY information is now incorporated in real-time during the overlapping night session. TX futures cost savings (2bp) are irrelevant because the alpha itself has disappeared. This is a structural change in market microstructure, not a statistical fluke."
